{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:80921d109ec3c58de1aa65aa6f18f9043bc53f700e0fcaddbbc6a0fe9dac491d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10c602ec35b948be5acf1fb330bdf59199c023942804634a1a491d787ecfbf6e",
      "text": "讲义气男子的休息日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98a20f44807048ffbab7ce438a7f9f8c7ecabf7fa6691e18e65a8e0a6b0ffe2c",
      "text": "玄武有事想拜托制作人。\n那个请求是，想给曾经受其照顾的福利院\n换一批新玩具，希望能陪他一起去挑。\n下一个休息日，两人动身前往玄武挑选的玩具店……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10c602ec35b948be5acf1fb330bdf59199c023942804634a1a491d787ecfbf6e",
      "text": "讲义气男子的休息日",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72506beb365818a0ef712dbc5d8db06b2fe14e23cd379a48a9839a4ff1955612",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，能耽误你一点时间吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43d3c6fba2a390611692f44454ed61c5a94943c96d930f78af693e4101b1ce86",
      "text": "好的，有什么事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:209fe8983ed2c6b3222f739b38f99adbe022a69488e605bf5eece265debd49d5",
      "text": "实不相瞒……我看重番长的本事，想拜托你一件事。\n是件重要的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f500dc18c6ba05c2ffd3d67c8774ed2b73c0aa531748ab2e59dada63c45929b5",
      "text": "重要的事，吗？\n要、要是我能帮上忙，请尽管吩咐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8527df2fdcc5f7b3f9a80a1b1cc349e198cbf3ee450c8ec6e81573a6cd7cae9",
      "text": "（能让玄武先生说到这个份上，\n到底发生什么事了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1cb39a4f99d59c273bcbcd4790960932ff4b2e2963110b2936351d6465d344",
      "text": "实际上，我曾受其照顾的福利院里的玩具，\n已经变得相当破旧了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75748e10a8bb8e070e4ed67c8a72aa3bf0b92cf424956c7c638080b97c5676ae",
      "text": "为了把它们换成新的，\n能陪我去买一趟吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a9c3bbb826b9d2ae947468b6cb02001671159497b829a7fef5b1df90097481",
      "text": "平时我都是一个人去买的，但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00bafcd3e317952483f58d9dc0b164f6dc34a2e6dbf7463f08d18bb169fd8755",
      "text": "光是我选的东西，\n难免千篇一律。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:acecfbc26dc4d54afdfc6f972b003d3ddb2617f2ece890308c40486033ffab31",
      "text": "原来是这样。如果是这种事请包在我身上。\n不过，为什么找我……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d6e1d454ee707f6fd0abb2049a8be75802d0eb819090aca33e36496aa6982ff",
      "text": "花音、咲大哥、道夫大哥、\n诚司大哥。还有我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:066996bacda7291b47675d65f9e92d1fc45e2fc0b7845afaded3977fa056191c",
      "text": "番长一个人就能统筹好这些个性强烈的偶像，\n我想仰仗一下你的手腕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4be89dafddbb29520e8a0d6bdcfeb2a8f132a07668f63e8659f1526d060f9f68",
      "text": "不过番长也很忙吧。\n我绝不勉强。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33deb5c81b80e68e9db855162dff275d6584e50174fd321c52810cf570a95d11",
      "text": "请务必让我帮这个忙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a8329ac7b0e37f3d32aacf6083fe588451e286699e4b5f8fe1cabc7351f098f",
      "text": "呵，谢了，番长。\n那事不宜迟，下一个休息日怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4cc091cb04776568812b3d86cde2fb2d8f8606c66e0d81f2748441aefc9eff8",
      "text": "有一家我经常光顾的大玩具店。\n就去那里吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69bd8292dafea7ec97c1a5813d171cccb4672c948e3b8b921bec5a7979c982b4",
      "text": "明白了。\n为了能帮上玄武先生的忙，我会努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5447fb68fd67c87c8cf42fd0d3b7e010b62fdb76bf1d01cc591c45fa8698b533",
      "text": "哈哈，那就拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000056:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06a42a98498d2741649fe711261c6d9ab9a755311a0620449ceb44872cc283c7",
      "text": "番长，这边。很准时嘛。\n难得的休息日还要你陪我跑一趟，抱歉啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29400cc41312001ac9091a674a69651d69a3483c7ce8a5f84ca179ec82584929",
      "text": "不会，我也好久没来这么大的玩具店了，\n心里其实兴奋得很呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43dc6bd301500b26dca223995227496bc2080221047cc7d87909810b0657b5f1",
      "text": "那敢情好。\n既然这样，我们这就进去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cac45d4178eafec3965308c9acf485d42c67acbca163ba18cc2b7e39c432f5c6",
      "text": "玩具店·店内",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa8dce594fb65dac7ab6c749e226e74c79dff880b86ecaf388d3d79351462da",
      "text": "这一带是毛绒玩具区啊。\n动物毛绒玩具大家都会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ad8023bd7a6b2bffa2b4fe4a88693f1936fd97547aba7f1a9d2842b971b772a",
      "text": "哇，种类好多啊。有绵羊、有小狗，\n这个是……耳廓狐吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd01f6a8d2a84361ff9dc3d66d84c5936a3ddaf830a3c56086a45882dbb4d71",
      "text": "嗯，是耳廓狐。这边是变色龙吗。\n……哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37d1a802acb45ad251cf145d9577ff8bcb848658c5900a71857e50a252f5e9e2",
      "text": "这个猫咪毛绒玩具，长得好像喵子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5288d143dd3938ec08d1fcb0b7287e21d3f0e31193349580b752ea5d55cb47d",
      "text": "真的耶！\n啊，那个毛绒玩具，花音君好像会喜欢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8f57bf2b2b70d5c20fd6d987a3c72fe265143dfd35256bddc7e30baec9a8356",
      "text": "那个也买下吧。……好，毛绒玩具差不多就\n买这些吧。差不多该换个区域了，番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5781dd2bef54e693e3879d2bc30663abd362b954fa043ab2966d55e89a0d6634",
      "text": "玄武先生，这个怎么样？\n是现在正在播出的特摄片玩具。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de0b9f4bded2a479e08b66daeef687c384a211729f5f19e1098652a0393a68ec",
      "text": "也是啊……虽然现在挺好，但要是往后用上好些年的话，\n可能会显得有些过时了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee245153db664c9376d1fde4fb334ad478e648c48f4f78f37fd080e7b0e340e9",
      "text": "不受流行影响、能玩很久的玩具才好。\n那样对福利院也更有益处。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b94237c51428458dd0a20a4102036faeaf99ad362ac3180a3de5d379b917066b",
      "text": "原来如此，确实是这样呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da8c66c43d0f5524d624774e55139fe1ec11d4f70c92f095169231b15e9652bc",
      "text": "（玄武先生，各方面都考虑得很周全呢……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67de369e4dc9ccefc52f40aa53013c516ee1c10e2bed26c545106fdc30230f6d",
      "text": "你特意提了建议我还这么挑剔，抱歉啊。\n不过，多谢你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fcb45a18aefba5930e75be9a7c0650ba1c3bf185a53bdc85dd03edc56194056",
      "text": "这边的卖场是益智玩具吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48400f40d54571d8c5633b35466a7b5d102fdd5ad3aadc2e6190cf22375f8a0c",
      "text": "玄武先生，请看这个。\n有个看起来很有趣的玩具哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5c0f025c29f6bb44c0a41ae8b618feb74eb2c0e26fb7f6c29af687c645ebd0d",
      "text": "能学习编程的玩具吗。\n现在还有这种东西啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a934be353d728ea6a0087e5e05931b5f4ddf596001eb50a358913c61a44c2ac0",
      "text": "百闻不如一见，试着玩一下吧。\n……把这个这样弄……摆弄这个电路吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17eb3febfa89bba41ea8b3a9a2a21653b5293b3fbf73341fff88a8fe3610a522",
      "text": "应该……是这边的电路吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63a8219ee47b761c591d769fea512995bb43e08393834eede02ef23b9d3814fc",
      "text": "原来是这么回事啊。这样一来这里就接通了……\n嘿。挺有意思的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fb7509c53931a502072cd7b7f9dba932b915237e430def263f8e405a9416dad",
      "text": "这个很棒呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ba8ff7bee7346b8bfb1c6ac290400f96f51cb105f5ee197c28fbc1706137dbd",
      "text": "嗯，这个也买回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3832f45cee2942a07f92b185cde4ed7d4b99998347ce6fba05749ea1fdaa656c",
      "text": "啊，玄武先生。这个怎么样？是用放进嘴里\n也无害的材质制作的玩具……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aece9e8edf811b0f8def7aa0026f3b5d591a8bfb5300c78dfc4682fe3e5d0c9d",
      "text": "嚯，福利院里也有小娃娃在，挺不错的。\n这个也买了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c06984b95d7ca3e6ddfa096f4ba8034aa488f1ec9c68f33602e5e0a2a48c074",
      "text": "好了，差不多该去结账了。\n多亏了番长，度过了一段很有意义的时光。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_d:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b561da2b8d19332688eb2a6fd732a877f69a73bcf79b737708e647bd932b01a",
      "text": "番长果然靠得住啊。\n谢了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a3d7c91400e654704fbaf4932b5d72f212fe263c470ffb481c45a92316e5aa",
      "text": "番长，现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06ee8009e90675442cb32b77023896d59a518d8b852bbbb8c2fb28a64e0d01d2",
      "text": "方便！没问题的。\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0025f8c23d1419bb695bd20581de3251d10937edb9aa1dc9f6800963645010ec",
      "text": "前阵子我把玩具送到福利院去了。\n是想来跟你报告一声。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcc516e98108a3348b4442a3cf09e339adb69aa4ed2a9301ffd11ff682c58ede",
      "text": "每一个玩具，大家都非常喜欢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3d1a1c16858ad7425ac46d7e8f6a61f62c9ac1a0432d29423b51bee36d89593",
      "text": "那个编程玩具甚至都到了抢着玩的程度。\n哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:105a1f387df469273310188a6743988085f79c06fb07610bce20159c6b37486e",
      "text": "我也带了一句给陪我一起挑玩具的\n番长的口信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae06d658b3c99f79bc2be9daccdec19c8fb2b888d72bbbc67fbc5cd4a86775c2",
      "text": "“谢谢你帮我们挑了玩具”，他们这么说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29a075af63d33be45fd18ef913500beabfc1765f0b6d630eb066702bc8fdc492",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n能帮上忙真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:001428b30ba6a8dcad8b271b34911fdb7f273da1d7f7962cb88c52e0cfd4eac2",
      "text": "找番长商量果然是对的。\n真帮了大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_026gen_01_1_2_026_01:1_2_026_01_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ce6489cdf50f8cf23eee192519d30da51527616224c919ccdb076274e26bca6",
      "text": "报恩谢德。今后番长要是遇到什么事，\n不管多么微不足道，都尽管依靠我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
